        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cost",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " all your remaining sanguimancy Hit Points (minimum 3)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A shell made up of hundreds of razor-thin needles of blood forms around you before exploding outward, lacerating foes in a "
          },
          {
            "type": "template",
            "shape": "emanation",
            "size": 30
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The needles deal piercing damage equal to double the number of sanguimancy Hit Points you spent, to a maximum of 80 damage. Creatures caught in the blast must attempt a "
          },
          {
            "type": "check",
            "statistic": "save:reflex",
            "dc": {
              "against": "class-or-spell-dc"
            },
            "basic": true
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " save. The DC for this save is your class DC or spell DC, whichever is higher."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
